        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Very straightforward process. Kind, professional, skilled and knowledgeable  staff and dentists. The dental assistant/ hygienist ( If I remember correctly, his name is Ralph) who assisted me was very skillful, friendly and professional. He had good, stable and very light hands. He ensured I was comfortable and had the best treatment.",
        "time": 1758211102,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Amanpreet Singh",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102815390868378609653/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUYIJpu1sXsCDuUfGqPLt8EeAatlg1Ob-znHC7TO1rcEC6cSkGz=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Dr. Waseef I just loved her, very professional, generous, very knowledgeable blessed to find her.\nAlso thanks to Joseph(the hygienist), Dina and Christine at the reception desk.\nOverall good experience.\n5 stars.",
        "time": 1768505317,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "H.i. Ke",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101458563225996560340/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU6xGVb8g4A0aGVd1VJTjEtOVTDk6WkGj1pXGCD0ma8xllWVLtq=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Well main doctor seems to know what he is doing but rest some at least with my experience hygienist is little unprofessional. He is going into very personal questions during conversation, instead he should focus on his work and recommendations..",
        "time": 1756492613,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Sharen Persaud",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114929073549580436743/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXcRsVjVM7HpYKwHhar7V5DuNuAxov0nUfCzXd68HTIO4JTPe4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "I had a wonderful experience today,  my first time at this dentistry.\nThe entire staff was  helpful and friendly.\nA big thank you to the hygienist who was super friendly and very, very kind & patient.",
        "time": 1754347063,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Victoria Ellis",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106549459915153555699/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXUaCo5AWoTE8gYedjagx7deVoQVbzM2I08KB8MZjd2lxhB6fhe=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "No one really \"likes\" going to the dentist, but I can definitely say Dental Montreal Vaudreuil has been the best experience I've had at any dentist. I've been 4x this year (a cleaning, a filling, an emergency booking and a root canal) and each time my experience was 10/10. They're easy to reach and easy to book with. There are no long waits when showing up for your appointment. The receptionists are very responsive and polite. The quotes I received for each service ended up being very close to the price I ended up paying (I've been quoted 1 price and then surprised when charged something completely different in the past at other dentists). The dental hygienists are very friendly, super gentle and attentive. I had a root canal yesterday that I was completely dreading after hearing some horror stories and I ended up experiencing no pain from it. Dr. Rami completely eased my anxiety; he was super calm and kept the mood light-hearted throughout the procedure which in turn helped me relax. All-in-all, very professional, welcoming and cohesive team that delivers excellent service overall. Very much recommend.",
        "time": 1724782747,
        "translated": false
      }
